            0.089,
            0.806,
            0.147
          ],
          "content": "14. In a room of 100 people, 99% are left-handed. How many left-handed people have to leave the room to bring that percentage down to 98%?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.82,
            0.086,
            0.921,
            0.139
          ],
          "content": "",
